+# Shared Widgets
+
+Reusable UI components used across features:
+
+```
+shared/widgets/
+  app_button.dart
+  app_text_field.dart
+  app_card.dart
+  app_data_table.dart
+  app_chart.dart
+  app_loading_state.dart
+  app_empty_state.dart
+  app_error_state.dart
+  app_snackbar.dart
+```
+
+Created in Phase 02. Until then this directory exists as a placeholder.
